@baseUrl = http://localhost:5128
@HostAddress = {{baseUrl}}

### =====================================================================
### 01. PUBLIC TENANT & SYSTEM DIAGNOSTICS TEST SUITE (COMPLETE COVERAGE)
### =====================================================================
### This suite tests public diagnostics, health checks, subdomain validation,
### and public tenant branding retrieval endpoints.

### =====================================================================
### 1.1 DIAGNOSTICS & HEALTH CHECKS (Public, Anonymous)
### =====================================================================

### 1.1.1 API Heartbeat Ping (English) - Expect 200 OK
# @name pingHeartbeatEn
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/diagnostics/ping
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

### 1.1.2 API Heartbeat Ping (Arabic) - Expect 200 OK
# @name pingHeartbeatAr
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/diagnostics/ping
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: ar

### 1.1.3 Full System Health Diagnostics (English) - Expect 200 OK (if healthy) or 503 Service Unavailable
# @name healthDiagnosticsEn
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/diagnostics/health
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

### 1.1.4 Full System Health Diagnostics (Arabic) - Expect 200 OK (if healthy) or 503 Service Unavailable
# @name healthDiagnosticsAr
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/diagnostics/health
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: ar

### =====================================================================
### 1.2 SUBDOMAIN AVAILABILITY VALIDATION
### =====================================================================

### 1.2.1 Subdomain Availability Check - Available Subdomain (Fresh) - Expect 200 OK with Data = true
# @name checkAvailableSubdomain
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/subdomains/freshcompany2024/availability
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

### 1.2.2 Subdomain Availability Check - Available Subdomain (Arabic Language) - Expect 200 OK with Data = true
# @name checkAvailableSubdomainAr
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/subdomains/newbusiness999/availability
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: ar

### 1.2.3 Subdomain Availability Check - Existing/Taken Subdomain (al-salamah) - Expect 200 OK with Data = false
# @name checkExistingSubdomain
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/subdomains/al-salamah/availability
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: ar

### 1.2.4 Subdomain Availability Check - System Tenant (admin) - Expect 200 OK with Data = false
# @name checkSystemSubdomain
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/subdomains/admin/availability
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

### 1.2.5 Subdomain Availability Check - Very Short Subdomain - Expect 200 OK or 400 Bad Request
# @name checkShortSubdomain
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/subdomains/ab/availability
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: ar

### 1.2.6 Subdomain Availability Check - Very Long Subdomain - Expect 200 OK or 400 Bad Request
# @name checkLongSubdomain
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/subdomains/thisisaverylongsubdomainnamethatmayexceedmaximumlengthallowed/availability
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

### 1.2.7 Subdomain Availability Check - With Numbers and Hyphens - Expect 200 OK
# @name checkAlphanumericSubdomain
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/subdomains/company-123-safe/availability
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: ar

### 1.2.8 Subdomain Availability Check - With Only Numbers - Expect 200 OK
# @name checkNumbersOnlySubdomain
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/subdomains/123456789/availability
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

### 1.2.9 Subdomain Availability Check - Reserved Keyword (auth) - Expect 200 OK with Data = false
# @name checkReservedAuthSubdomain
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/subdomains/auth/availability
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

### 1.2.10 Subdomain Availability Check - Reserved Keyword (system) - Expect 200 OK with Data = false
# @name checkReservedSystemSubdomain
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/subdomains/system/availability
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: ar

### =====================================================================
### 1.3 PUBLIC TENANT BRANDING & SETTINGS LOOKUP
### =====================================================================

### 1.3.1 Public Tenant Branding Lookup - Al-Salamah Tenant (English) - Expect 200 OK
# @name getPublicBrandingEn
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/settings/public-branding
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en
X-Tenant-Domain: al-salamah

### 1.3.2 Public Tenant Branding Lookup - Al-Salamah Tenant (Arabic) - Expect 200 OK
# @name getPublicBrandingAr
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/settings/public-branding
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: ar
X-Tenant-Domain: al-salamah

### 1.3.3 Public Tenant Branding via /branding Endpoint (Backwards Compatibility) - Expect 200 OK
# @name getPublicBrandingCompat
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/settings/branding
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en
X-Tenant-Domain: al-salamah

### 1.3.4 Public Tenant Branding for Case-Insensitive Subdomain - Expect 200 OK or 400 Bad Request
# @name getPublicBrandingCaseInsensitive
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/settings/public-branding
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en
X-Tenant-Domain: AL-SALAMAH

### =====================================================================
### 1.4 NEGATIVE TEST CASES - MISSING/INVALID HEADERS
### =====================================================================

### 1.4.1 Get Public Branding WITHOUT Required X-Tenant-Domain Header (Expect 400 Bad Request)
# @name getPublicBrandingMissingHeader
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/settings/public-branding
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: ar

### 1.4.2 Get Public Branding via /branding WITHOUT Header (Expect 400 Bad Request)
# @name getPublicBrandingCompatMissingHeader
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/settings/branding
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

### 1.4.3 Public Tenant Branding with Empty X-Tenant-Domain Header (Expect 400 Bad Request)
# @name getPublicBrandingEmptyHeader
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/settings/public-branding
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: ar
X-Tenant-Domain: 

### 1.4.4 Public Tenant Branding with Whitespace X-Tenant-Domain Header (Expect 400 Bad Request)
# @name getPublicBrandingWhitespaceHeader
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/settings/public-branding
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en
X-Tenant-Domain:    

### =====================================================================
### 1.5 EDGE CASES & INVALID TENANT DOMAINS
### =====================================================================

### 1.5.1 Public Branding Lookup - Non-Existent Domain (Expect 400 Bad Request)
# @name getPublicBrandingInvalidDomain
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/settings/public-branding
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en
X-Tenant-Domain: non-existent-company-domain-999

### 1.5.2 Public Branding Lookup - Suspended/Inactive Tenant (If Such Domain Exists - Expect 400 or Filtered Response)
# @name getPublicBrandingInactiveTenant
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/settings/public-branding
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: ar
X-Tenant-Domain: suspended-tenant-001

### 1.5.3 Public Branding Lookup - SQL Injection Attempt in Domain Header (Expect 400 Bad Request)
# @name getPublicBrandingSqlInjection
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/settings/public-branding
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en
X-Tenant-Domain: al-salamah'; DROP TABLE tenants; --

### 1.5.4 Public Branding Lookup - XSS Attempt in Domain Header (Expect 400 Bad Request)
# @name getPublicBrandingXssAttempt
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/settings/public-branding
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: ar
X-Tenant-Domain: <script>alert('xss')</script>

### 1.5.5 Public Branding Lookup - Unicode Characters in Domain (Expect 400 Bad Request)
# @name getPublicBrandingUnicodeDomain
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/settings/public-branding
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: ar
X-Tenant-Domain: شركة-عربية

### 1.5.6 Public Branding Lookup - Very Long Domain String (Expect 400 Bad Request)
# @name getPublicBrandingLongDomain
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/settings/public-branding
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en
X-Tenant-Domain: thisisterribleverylongdomainnamethatexceedsmaximumlengthallowedforsubdomainregistrationinourapplication

### 1.5.7 Public Branding with Missing Accept Header (Expect 200 OK - Optional)
# @name getPublicBrandingNoAcceptHeader
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/settings/public-branding
Accept-Language: en
X-Tenant-Domain: al-salamah

### 1.5.8 Subdomain Check - Special Characters (Expect 400 Bad Request)
# @name checkSpecialCharSubdomain
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/subdomains/invalid!@#$%/availability
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: ar

### =====================================================================
### 1.6 PERFORMANCE & LOAD TESTING (Light Testing)
### =====================================================================

### 1.6.1 Rapid Health Check Requests (First of multiple) - Test Load Balancing
# @name healthLoadTest1
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/diagnostics/health
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

### 1.6.2 Rapid Ping Requests for Performance - Test Response Time
# @name pingLoadTest1
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/diagnostics/ping
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: ar
